@* An icon leads or trails depending on where you write it — the badge is a flex row with a gap,
   so source order is the only thing that decides. shadcn marks the two with
   data-icon="inline-start|end"; here nothing needs marking, because nothing reads it. *@
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
    <Badge Variant="secondary"><Icon Name="badge-check" />Verified</Badge>
    <Badge Variant="outline">Bookmark<Icon Name="bookmark" /></Badge>
</div>
